#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/single_line_conductor.rst:7
msgid "Single line conductor"
msgstr "单行导线"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/single_line_conductor.rst:9
msgid ""
"The single line conductors is used at `single line diagrams`_. Single line "
"conductors are the simplified notation for representing two and three phase "
"power system drawing using a common `conductor`_. Single line conductors are"
" only used to represent power systems, control systems are normally not "
"represented."
msgstr ""
"单线导体用于 `单线图 <single line diagrams_>`_。单线导体是代表使用普通 `导体 "
"<conductor_>`_。单线导体仅用于代表动力系统，控制系统通常不代表。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/single_line_conductor.rst:16
msgid ""
"At fluid power schemas, the pressure and return line are represented by the "
"same `conductor`_."
msgstr "在流体动力计时，压力和回线由相同的 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 表示。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/single_line_conductor.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech does not allow defining any `conductor property`_ at single "
"line conductor. The single line conductor does not have the possibility of "
"text linking."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 不允许在单行导线上定义任何 `导体属性 <conductor property_>`_。单行导线没有文本链接的可能性。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/type/single_line_conductor.rst:24
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech single line conductors"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech单行导线"

